        {
          "text": " Ido arai kinalai enabi kiner akirot, eoŋ EJAKAIT enalat enabi ŋol, ariori da akakan mama ejai, kamudia ŋes kokidin otunaka Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.9",
