        },
        {
          "text": "ebala Ejakait EDEKE ebe, Kwape ajaria, karaida keiaas ituŋa nul luuni kotomaken, timam keyuut idwekec lusap ka lupesur; kes bonik tikeyuun, konye iswapi akwap. ",
