        {
          "text": " Konye arai kesal aatoŋot kotomaken naitolomuni idwe lusap ka lupesur, naelomuniata mamakus, ianyunete yesi da ikeeerotin ka akeeeswamisio: kitalakario kotoma aronis naayau eoŋ Yerusalem, nun ke re nuayau kotomaken. ",
